                                "sense_id": "bce85a7e-41ef-3bfd-ab94-196fb00afe6c",
                                "text": "I love my father's northern land, / Where the dark pine-trees grow, / And the bold Baltic's echoing strand / Looks o'er each grassy oe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
